@startuml View Categories - Sequence Diagram

actor Admin
participant "CategoryController" as CatCtrl
participant "Category" as Category
participant "Product" as Product
participant "View" as View

== View Categories ==
Admin -> CatCtrl: index()
CatCtrl -> CatCtrl: checkAdminPermission()
CatCtrl -> Category: withCount('products')->get()
Category --> CatCtrl: categories
CatCtrl -> View: show admin.categories.index(categories)
View --> Admin: display categories list

@enduml
